										<ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="c75032ad-ad29-4122-ac7f-4b7f5a7c091f">
											<SHORT-NAME>MemInvocation</SHORT-NAME>
											<DESC>
												<L-2 L="EN">Only INDIRECT_STATIC and INDIRECT_DYNAMIC are supported.

Default case is INDIRECT_STATIC.
Use INDIRECT_DYNAMIC only when the Mem driver together with the vMem(s) are intended to be activated dynamically by the MemAcc.
For more information see technical reference.

Mem adapter is always accessed over the function pointer table and will be initialized and scheduled by the MemAcc.
</L-2>
											</DESC>
