												<L-2 L="EN">This value specifies the unique numeric identifier which is used to reference an underlying vMemInstance or FlsConfigSet or EepInitconfiguration in case multiple devices of the same type shall be addressed by one driver.
This value will be assigned to the symbolic name derived from the MemInstance container short name.</L-2>
											</DESC>
